-- holding its body, its comment and the grants that say who may call it —
-- and run `pnpm gen:functions`. `pnpm check` fails if the two disagree.
--
-- Why this exists (ADR 0015): the seven migrations before this one define 47
-- functions, four of them more than once, and `planning.transition_plan`
-- three times. A migration is a record of a change, which is the right way to
-- apply a schema and the wrong way to keep something a person has to read.
